---
title: How Workline turns handwritten math into targeted feedback
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Workline handwriting-feedback pipeline
  accDescr: A handwritten math photo is transcribed, confirmed by the learner, checked deterministically, and returned with a precise place to revise.

  subgraph reading["1 · Read the work"]
    direction LR
    photo["Handwritten math photo"] --> vision["Vision transcription<br/>Order steps and flag uncertain text"]
    vision --> review["Learner review<br/>Confirm or edit the transcription"]
  end

  subgraph response["2 · Check and respond"]
    direction LR
    checker["Deterministic checker<br/>Validate each transformation"] --> feedback["Targeted feedback<br/>Locate the first break"]
    feedback --> revise["Revise and retry<br/>Return with a confirmed attempt"]
  end

  reading --> response

  classDef input fill:#f4f0e6,stroke:#c69214,color:#182b49,stroke-width:2px
  classDef human fill:#ffffff,stroke:#00c6d7,color:#182b49,stroke-width:2px
  classDef system fill:#eef6f9,stroke:#00629b,color:#182b49,stroke-width:2px
  classDef outcome fill:#f0f7ec,stroke:#3f6d3a,color:#182b49,stroke-width:2px
  class photo input
  class review human
  class vision,checker system
  class feedback,revise outcome
